{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6063e681174a704ba21a7221eb01c02be2435832ec59743f56e1eb989c36004f", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD』第三幕の稽古が始まった。\n紗代子も、演技のレッスンを重ねている）", "zh": "（《STARDOM ROAD》第三幕的排练开始了。\n纱代子也在不断进行演技训练）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "f7fccc368656283923b13080f4a76382e7e0035d05ceaf1b8542b78e7d2ee8b0", "ja": "{$P$}。今のお芝居、どうでしたか？\n気になったこと、遠慮なく言ってください！", "zh": "{$P$}，刚才的表演怎么样？\n有什么在意的地方，请尽管说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1002_p", "source_sha256": "39ffc83c929b69c9f98adc3c9f7c23721b1e0269067b37241ade07e809ccdccd", "ja": "いや、いい感じだったと思うよ。\n藍のカッコよさがちゃんと出てたし……。", "zh": "不，我觉得效果挺不错的。\n藍的帅气确实展现出来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "c5d31fc4e6a467a4359db98e1cd1e2bad9407638a22e153265b6e7fadac0860d", "ja": "本当に、何も気になるところはなかったですか？\n些細な事でもいいんです！", "zh": "真的一点让你在意的地方都没有吗？\n哪怕是些小事也可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1004_p", "source_sha256": "00015afd57a091b3e2e0a902c35558d99bdbac0a43715644b4c6814ef1538211", "ja": "そんなに念を押さなくても、嘘はつかないけど……\n何か心配な事でもあるのか？", "zh": "不用这么反复确认，我不会撒谎的……\n是有什么担心的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "3d270b485112b1e777772a981a20d749cb9a4a81b8d123dc4168ac97dafb21e0", "ja": "す、すみません！　その、心配というか……\n藍は、『I.V.』のオリジナルメンバーなので。", "zh": "对、对不起！那个，与其说是担心……\n因为蓝是《I.V.》的初始成员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "326efe2273a6153db62688234862f23b39d3ef790d0a65c66c47746e494e0bc9", "ja": "カリスマ性とか、風格とかがないとですよね。\n私でちゃんとそう見えるのか、気になっちゃって……。", "zh": "得有魅力和气场才行呢。\n我就是有点在意，自己看起来是不是真的像那么回事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e17401b23f6969d502326c0f01f4dcf0a7eba89f3df811bdf53abd109b13bf89", "ja": "なるほど。\n確かに、『藍』としての説得力は欲しいか……。", "zh": "原来如此。确实，还是需要有作为“藍”的说服力吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "4eb87b258bf4170138d09a6729099694b4d5814737de0990e846037439eab7a4", "ja": "でも、何もないならよかったです。\n藍は引き続き練習していくとして……。", "zh": "不过，既然没什么问题，那就太好了。\n小蓝还要继续练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "5d5119f570884fb3c896c044e24c9520e2a5a1753fd359d1ebdf5bf2db258eee", "ja": "少しだけ、なるの台詞もやってみたいんですけど、\n見てもらえますか？　できれば、他のみんなも。", "zh": "我想稍微试着念念成的台词，\n可以请你看看吗？如果可以的话，其他人也一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1010_p", "source_sha256": "492f0c693975ef15254670dab830f0601bde3f0e4a7094c7b7c1f6e07c9db5e4", "ja": "もちろん良いけど……なんで他の役を？", "zh": "当然可以，不过……为什么要对其他角色的台词呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "5bf348fd6a3f6fc94ac516f6eb412525006125d596c1079e88422539bba1f8fc", "ja": "明日の稽古は、昴ちゃんと私だけなんですけど。\n時間があるなら、他も進めておこうかと思って。", "zh": "明天的排练只有昴和我两个人，不过……  \n如果有时间的话，我想着先把其他部分也推进一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "885eb03a8fcfb12c07748352c387df1453a6e6e9bcf3a8695f0d0d86c4d82295", "ja": "他の登場人物を演じてみることで、\n藍のことがもっとわかるかもって……。", "zh": "通过试着饰演其他登场人物，说不定就能更了解小蓝……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1bc6e9ceb66c86f5ed6e7ab36fa0b0ffbdd5924a7b1ddec2d4748fb2c68d7d89", "ja": "なるほど。確かに、視点を変えて\nわかる事もあるかもしれないな。", "zh": "原来如此。确实，换个视角，\n或许也能了解到一些事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "d43ae3c11b5d14007133dd3a378bfe95b78dd8d4861b7ac44003dcf7309a9956", "ja": "{$P$}も、そう思いますか！？", "zh": "{$P$}也这么觉得吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "4a332cdb336a1e55ec2eeb34506cb76c166503487fe3fcd77a24ed91f1cece50", "ja": "だったら私、やってみます！\n何か気付けたら、みんなにも共有できるかも……。", "zh": "那我就试试看！\n要是能发现些什么，说不定也能和大家分享……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7a85bb0949d33a536000b2dc3ad8af76e981a5fb76fbbfffbbfc9bd9ee2cc77e", "ja": "そうか。でもくれぐれも、オーバーワークに\nならないよう気を付けてほしいかな。", "zh": "这样啊。不过还是希望你千万注意，别让自己过度劳累。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "56ef4c8d04ac02a80929117d2bf7825c92ad5b84cb5f079ce10e21bb4a7a8a86", "ja": "わかりました、気を付けますね！\nでももし、私が暴走しそうになったら……。", "zh": "我明白了，我会注意的！\n不过，如果我好像要失控的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "d4656e2f12ee18bc5aab503a999a28f53644fd5f4040fae470e704776f6cec0d", "ja": "その時は、{$P$}が\n止めてください！　お願いします！", "zh": "到那时候，请{$P$}先生阻止我！拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0503_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f24b4263e228c7f3ece41f6b6e7c50b0bae7b8258eaa6e298bb4dc24968d51d8", "ja": "（紗代子の熱意は、舞台にいい影響を与えるだろう。\n無理をし過ぎないよう、ちゃんと見ておかないとな）", "zh": "（纱代子的热情应该会给舞台带来积极的影响。可得好好看着她，别让她太勉强自己了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
